  "bodyHash": "fiRVppNWXDA=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Forge？<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-keybinding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在这里</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-keybinding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern KeyBinding</a> 的官方移植版。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em><strong>对于普通玩家：</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em><strong>功能</strong></em></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>现在你可以使用键修饰符来定义按键绑定的激活键。例如 \"Ctrl + G\" 或 \"Alt + S\"；</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>现在，具有相同激活键但不同键冲突上下文的按键绑定将不再冲突。</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><em>\"非冲突键\"（默认关闭）：如果按下相同的键，所有具有相同键的按键绑定都将被激活。</em></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>配置</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"># ModernKeyBinding-Config</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> # 非冲突键功能。设置为 true 以启用。[默认：false] </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">nonConflictKeys=false</span></p><pre>&nbsp;</pre><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>对于开发者：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">该模组的 WIKI（<a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/ModernKeyBinding/blob/Forge/1.7.10/README.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">英文</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://wiki.nova-committee.cn/project-1/doc-10/\" rel=\"nofollow\">简体中文</a>）。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>注意：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>绝对可以</strong></span>将该模组添加到你的整合包中；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">访问 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flegacyfabric.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">legacyfabric.net</a> 了解更多关于 Legacyfabric 的信息。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
